  "body_html": "<p>name: Eu Sou o Cosmos<br />date: 2018-04-12<br />type: sonic art<br />event: Exposição “Eu Sou o Cosmos”</p>\n<p>city: Lisboa, Portugal<br />place: Galeria Cristina Guerra</p>\n<p>client: Rui Toscano<br />collaboration: Rui Toscano</p>\n<p>description PT: Co-autoria de peça de arte com Rui Toscano, no contexto da sua exposição “Eu Sou o Cosmos”, patente na galeria Cristina Guerra, em Lisboa. Música feita a partir de sintetizadores analógicos, usando geometria para gerar as sequências, gravada numa só sessão “live on tape” de 4 horas de duração.</p>\n<p>description EN: Co-authorship of an art piece with Rui Toscano, as part of his exhibition “Eu Sou o Cosmos”, showcased at the Cristina Guerra Gallery in Lisbon. Music created using analog synthesizers, employing geometry to generate sequences, recorded in a single “live on tape” session lasting 4 hours.</p>\n<p>links: <a href=\"http://www.cristinaguerra.com/exhibition.current.php\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://www.cristinaguerra.com/exhibition.current.php</a></p>\n<div id=\"photonic-flickr-stream-9\" class=\"photonic-flickr-stream photonic-stream\">\n<p><!-- ./photonic-level-1-container --><br /><span id=\"photonic-flickr-stream-9-container-end\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<p><!-- .photonic-stream or .photonic-panel --></p>\n\n<!-- wp:photonic/gallery {\"shortcode\":\"{\\u0022type\\u0022:\\u0022flickr\\u0022,\\u0022view\\u0022:\\u0022photosets\\u0022,\\u0022photoset_id\\u0022:\\u002272157667966264698\\u0022,\\u0022user_id\\u0022:\\u0022141356798@N05\\u0022,\\u0022columns\\u0022:\\u0022auto\\u0022,\\u0022layout\\u0022:\\u0022circle\\u0022}\"} /-->",
